  "protocol": "Synthetic sparse coupled SPD mass, fixed random and already orthonormal bases. Both complete CholeskyQR passes, cached AX transforms and final M X retained. Stage timing includes resetting X and AX from device copies. Allocation/module preparation/capture/host validation excluded. Fixed baseline-then-candidate order with cached compilation. Every first/measured output checks M-orthogonality, fresh AX and MX, and status; no whole-eigensolve speed claim. External occupancy required. Candidate uses existing gx/bx scratch, without adding dense buffers."
